# Warrant binding manifest (VER04 section 6, VER04j section 4.6) for
# code/specs/note-frequency.warrant.
#
# Each Warrant operation binds to a real public export of
# `coding_adventures_note_frequency` (`src/lib.rs`), returning `Result<T, String>`
# where every `Err(_)` normalizes to the single Warrant error `NoteError.INVALID_NOTE`
# (`err_any=INVALID_NOTE`).
#
# proofs_not_live=frontend-refuses-lib: the Rust-subset WIR front end refuses
